	int "One interrupt ahead of any job (ns)"
	default 72400 if EFR32_RADIO_TIMING_QEMU
	default 58100
	help
	  The longest interrupt, outermost and nested ones included
	  (CONFIG_TRACING_USER enter/exit hooks), in steady state: silicon
	  58.1 us, QEMU 72.4 us; admission's checks in the interrupts that
	  release jobs are part of it (39.4 us on silicon without them).
	  Silicon's boot maximum, 95.1 us, is before the radio starts.
	  Admission's blocking allowance, and the delay one interrupt can add
	  between a frame's end and its completion's post.

